    "1 (16 ounce) can garbanzo beans, drained",
    "0.25 cup panko bread crumbs, or as needed",
    "0.25 cup chopped onion",
    "0.25 cup olive oil",
    "1 egg",
    "2 tablespoons dried parsley",
